        {
          "text": "We! Kolizya mweembo! Sinkondo uleza mbuli insika kuŋanda yaJehova, nkaambo basotoka cizuminano cangu, amulao wangu bausampaula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.1",
